# App Updates Rule

When you create, edit, or delete project files (excluding node_modules, .next, .cursor, etc.), append an entry to `AppUpdates.MD` at the top of the Changelog section (below the "Changelog (ongoing)" header).

**Format:**
- `## YYYY-MM-DD – Brief title`
- Bullet list of edited files
- Optional: **Updates:** one-line summary

Do this as the final step before completing your response.

**Skip** when the only change was adding or editing `AppUpdates.MD` or this rule file (to avoid recursive updates).
